{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"本認定原則依據建築技術規則建築設計施工編第二百六十三條第二項\n\n\n    規定訂定。","id":"基隆市-FL004318/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"d85f6ea7054e76d3eb0cf2a26b315a4ce63ec7edbb41e69da64afbe9c411b49e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"山坡地範圍內之建築基地符合以下各款情形之一者，得免退縮設置人\n\n\n    行步道：\n\n\n   （一）建築基地面積未達一千五百平方公尺。\n\n\n   （二）於已開闢完成之重劃地區。\n\n\n   （三）建築基地通行採人車分道設計，符合分道功能。\n\n\n   （四）建築基地臨接之道路無法通行車輛。","id":"基隆市-FL004318/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"d584cf3967cc0d3707c9669eb36d8ce40629f4ce6fb62e95c2e266fa552ebfd6","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"基隆市山坡地建築退縮設置人行步道認定原則修正對照表.pdf","url":"https://exlaw.klcg.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=12893&id=FL004318&type=LAW"}],"category":"農業與山坡地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"基隆市-FL004318","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"民國 111 年 09 月 22 日","name":"基隆市山坡地建築退縮設置人行步道認定原則","region":"基隆市","source":"基隆市法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://exlaw.klcg.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=FL004318","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:02+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"ffdd8c37d3c100d3202d2e49b23c435a34a2e399adb3e0ae6e6a6e0b04d81462","sourceRecordId":"基隆市-FL004318","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"民國 111 年 09 月 22 日","effectiveDate":""}}